Body:
Fix PRs are up:

- **opentui PR #1279** (the fix itself): https://github.com/anomalyco/opentui/pull/1279
- **opencode PR #37805** (bump dependency to pick up the fix): https://github.com/anomalyco/opencode/pull/37805

To unblock yourself in the meantime, you can:
```
npm install github:AH64-dll/opentui#8989f078747116b42dda6af1fe1549e9de1e5cc8
```
or apply the one-line fix manually to `node_modules/@opentui/core/renderer.js`:

In the `loop()` function, find the `finally` block (around line 4500) and change:
```js
} finally {
  this.rendering = false
  if (this._destroyPending) {
    this.finalizeDestroy()
  }
  this.resolveIdleIfNeeded()
}
```
to:
```js
} finally {
  this.rendering = false
  if (this._destroyPending) {
    this.finalizeDestroy()
  } else if (this.immediateRerenderRequested) {
    this.immediateRerenderRequested = false
    setImmediate(() => {
      if (!this._isDestroyed) this.requestRender()
    })
  }
  this.resolveIdleIfNeeded()
}
```
